' R44 compiler Gate C diagnostic (not a performance benchmark).
' Run this as a COMPILED program under WinUAE (same R44 library).
' Uses only AMOS Wait for pauses: no Wait Key and no AMCAF.
' READ THE LAST VISIBLE STAGE BEFORE ANY FAILURE.
Cls
Print "R44 COMPILER / GATE C TRACE"
Print "01 BEFORE AGA PROBE"
Wait 100
Aga Probe
Print "02 AGA PROBE RETURNED"
Wait 100
Print "03 BEFORE AGA SCREEN OPEN"
Wait 100
_OPEN=Aga Screen Open(320,256,32,$00021000)
Print "04 OPEN RETURNED ";_OPEN
Wait 150
If _OPEN<>0
   Print "05 BEFORE AGA SCREEN CLOSE"
   Wait 150
   Aga Screen Close
End If
Amos To Front
Print "06 AFTER AGA SCREEN CLOSE"
Print "OPEN RESULT ";_OPEN
Print "COMPILER TRACE COMPLETED"
Wait 250
End
